Come on! Take Kelvezu's egg to the Frozen Abyss of the Sea.
Kelvezu will follow it there and serve as bait to lure the Snowstorm Dragon out of its Lair.
Kelvezu and the Snowstorm Dragon have been enemies since the 2nd War of the Gods.

Activate the Kelvezu Egg in the marked area of the Frozen Abyss of the Sea and defeat the Snowstorm Dragon.
A light will mark the place to activate the Kelvezu Egg.

WARNING: If you are defeated or disconnect from the game during the battle against the Snowstorm Dragon, you must go back to Commander Derik for a new egg and start over.

Come back here when you are done.
